  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a large skillet over medium high heat with coconut oil.",
    "Add the chicken breast to the skillet and cook until browned and cooked through.",
    "Add the chopped Thai holy basil to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Warm the gluten free tortilla in the microwave for 20 seconds.",
    "Assemble the wrap by slicing the cooked chicken and adding it to the tortilla.",
    "Squeeze lime juice over the top of the chicken and add salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Add shredded lettuce to the wrap and serve immediately.",
    "Repeat the process to make the remaining wraps."
